{"audio": "matthew-15.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 265867, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1600, "text": "Matthew, Chapter Fifteen."}, {"start_ms": 1600, "end_ms": 10267, "text": "Then came to Jesus scribes and Pharisees, which were of Jerusalem, saying, Why do thy disciples transgress the tradition of the elders?"}, {"start_ms": 10267, "end_ms": 13067, "text": "for they wash not their hands when they eat bread."}, {"start_ms": 13067, "end_ms": 19733, "text": "But he answered and said unto them, Why do ye also transgress the commandment of God by your tradition?"}, {"start_ms": 19733, "end_ms": 28800, "text": "For God commanded, saying, Honour thy father and mother: and, He that curseth father or mother, let him die the death."}, {"start_ms": 28800, "end_ms": 39867, "text": "But ye say, Whosoever shall say to his father or his mother, It is a gift, by whatsoever thou mightest be profited by me; And honour not his father or his mother, he shall be free."}, {"start_ms": 39867, "end_ms": 44667, "text": "Thus have ye made the commandment of God of none effect by your tradition."}, {"start_ms": 44667, "end_ms": 55867, "text": "Ye hypocrites, well did Esaias prophesy of you, saying, This people draweth nigh unto me with their mouth, and honoureth me with their lips; but their heart is far from me."}, {"start_ms": 55867, "end_ms": 61200, "text": "But in vain they do worship me, teaching for doctrines the commandments of men."}, {"start_ms": 61200, "end_ms": 72000, "text": "And he called the multitude, and said unto them, Hear, and understand: Not that which goeth into the mouth defileth a man; but that which cometh out of the mouth, this defileth a man."}, {"start_ms": 72000, "end_ms": 79467, "text": "Then came his disciples, and said unto him, Knowest thou that the Pharisees were offended, after they heard this saying?"}, {"start_ms": 79467, "end_ms": 85467, "text": "But he answered and said, Every plant, which my heavenly Father hath not planted, shall be rooted up."}, {"start_ms": 85467, "end_ms": 89067, "text": "Let them alone: they be blind leaders of the blind."}, {"start_ms": 89067, "end_ms": 93067, "text": "And if the blind lead the blind, both shall fall into the ditch."}, {"start_ms": 93067, "end_ms": 96933, "text": "Then answered Peter and said unto him, Declare unto us this parable."}, {"start_ms": 96933, "end_ms": 100800, "text": "And Jesus said, Are ye also yet without understanding?"}, {"start_ms": 100800, "end_ms": 108800, "text": "Do not ye yet understand, that whatsoever entereth in at the mouth goeth into the belly, and is cast out into the draught?"}, {"start_ms": 108800, "end_ms": 114267, "text": "But those things which proceed out of the mouth come forth from the heart; and they defile the man."}, {"start_ms": 114267, "end_ms": 127200, "text": "For out of the heart proceed evil thoughts, murders, adulteries, fornications, thefts, false witness, blasphemies: These are the things which defile a man: but to eat with unwashen hands defileth not a man."}, {"start_ms": 127200, "end_ms": 132000, "text": "Then Jesus went thence, and departed into the coasts of Tyre and Sidon."}, {"start_ms": 132000, "end_ms": 141733, "text": "And, behold, a woman of Canaan came out of the same coasts, and cried unto him, saying, Have mercy on me, O Lord, thou Son of David; my daughter is grievously vexed with a devil."}, {"start_ms": 141733, "end_ms": 144133, "text": "But he answered her not a word."}, {"start_ms": 144133, "end_ms": 149733, "text": "And his disciples came and besought him, saying, Send her away; for she crieth after us."}, {"start_ms": 149733, "end_ms": 154800, "text": "But he answered and said, I am not sent but unto the lost sheep of the house of Israel."}, {"start_ms": 154800, "end_ms": 159067, "text": "Then came she and worshipped him, saying, Lord, help me."}, {"start_ms": 159067, "end_ms": 164667, "text": "But he answered and said, It is not meet to take the children's bread, and to cast it to dogs."}, {"start_ms": 164667, "end_ms": 169867, "text": "And she said, Truth, Lord: yet the dogs eat of the crumbs which fall from their masters' table."}, {"start_ms": 169867, "end_ms": 176533, "text": "Then Jesus answered and said unto her, O woman, great is thy faith: be it unto thee even as thou wilt."}, {"start_ms": 176533, "end_ms": 179733, "text": "And her daughter was made whole from that very hour."}, {"start_ms": 179733, "end_ms": 187600, "text": "And Jesus departed from thence, and came nigh unto the sea of Galilee; and went up into a mountain, and sat down there."}, {"start_ms": 187600, "end_ms": 206000, "text": "And great multitudes came unto him, having with them those that were lame, blind, dumb, maimed, and many others, and cast them down at Jesus' feet; and he healed them: Insomuch that the multitude wondered, when they saw the dumb to speak, the maimed to be whole, the lame to walk,"}, {"start_ms": 206000, "end_ms": 210000, "text": "and the blind to see: and they glorified the God of Israel."}, {"start_ms": 210000, "end_ms": 222400, "text": "Then Jesus called his disciples unto him, and said, I have compassion on the multitude, because they continue with me now three days, and have nothing to eat: and I will not send them away fasting, lest they faint in the way."}, {"start_ms": 222400, "end_ms": 231733, "text": "And his disciples say unto him, Whence should we have so much bread in the wilderness, as to fill so great a multitude?"}, {"start_ms": 231733, "end_ms": 235200, "text": "And Jesus saith unto them, How many loaves have ye?"}, {"start_ms": 235200, "end_ms": 238133, "text": "And they said, Seven, and a few little fishes."}, {"start_ms": 238133, "end_ms": 241200, "text": "And he commanded the multitude to sit down on the ground."}, {"start_ms": 241200, "end_ms": 250267, "text": "And he took the seven loaves and the fishes, and gave thanks, and brake them, and gave to his disciples, and the disciples to the multitude."}, {"start_ms": 250267, "end_ms": 256133, "text": "And they did all eat, and were filled: and they took up of the broken meat that was left seven baskets full."}, {"start_ms": 256133, "end_ms": 260933, "text": "And they that did eat were four thousand men, beside women and children."}, {"start_ms": 260933, "end_ms": 265867, "text": "And he sent away the multitude, and took ship, and came into the coasts of Magdala."}], "words": [{"t": "Matthew,", "s": 223, "e": 587, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 689, "e": 1013, "si": 0}, {"t": "Fifteen.", "s": 1053, "e": 1499, "si": 0}, {"t": "Then", "s": 2221, "e": 2401, "si": 1}, {"t": "came", "s": 2501, "e": 2761, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 2781, "e": 2861, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jesus", "s": 2921, "e": 3281, "si": 1}, {"t": "scribes", "s": 3341, "e": 3802, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 3822, "e": 3922, "si": 1}, {"t": "Pharisees,", "s": 3962, "e": 4602, "si": 1}, {"t": "which", "s": 4923, "e": 5103, "si": 1}, {"t": "were", "s": 5143, "e": 5283, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 5303, "e": 5383, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jerusalem,", "s": 5423, "e": 5984, "si": 1}, {"t": "saying,", "s": 6084, "e": 6444, "si": 1}, {"t": "Why", "s": 6964, "e": 7144, "si": 1}, {"t": "do", "s": 7205, "e": 7265, "si": 1}, {"t": "thy", "s": 7345, "e": 7485, "si": 1}, {"t": "disciples", "s": 7525, "e": 8125, "si": 1}, {"t": "transgress", "s": 8185, "e": 8786, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 8846, "e": 8946, "si": 1}, {"t": "tradition", "s": 8986, "e": 9446, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 9506, "e": 9566, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 9606, "e": 9667, "si": 1}, {"t": "elders?", "s": 9747, "e": 10127, "si": 1}, {"t": "for", "s": 10569, "e": 10670, "si": 2}, {"t": "they", "s": 10710, "e": 10811, "si": 2}, {"t": "wash", "s": 10891, "e": 11153, "si": 2}, {"t": "not", "s": 11214, "e": 11375, "si": 2}, {"t": "their", "s": 11395, "e": 11536, "si": 2}, {"t": "hands", "s": 11596, "e": 12020, "si": 2}, {"t": "when", "s": 12060, "e": 12181, "si": 2}, {"t": "they", "s": 12201, "e": 12302, "si": 2}, {"t": "eat", "s": 12402,